{"id":"w-h1-38b","pp":10,"note":"합성함수는 ‘안쪽부터’, 역함수는 ‘거꾸로 되돌리기’예요. f^{−1}(a)는 f(□) = a인 □를 찾는 것이라는 뜻을 먼저 잡게 해 주세요.","tips":{"1":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽 g(a)부터","2":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽 g(a)부터","3":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽 g(a)부터","4":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽 g(a)부터","5":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽 g(a)부터"},"items":[{"no":1,"st":1,"q":"f(x) = −2x + 4, g(x) = 2x^{2} + x + 1일 때, (f∘g)(−2)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"−10","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"g(−2) = 2 × (−2)^{2} + (−2) + 1 = 7","memo":"안쪽 g부터"},{"s":"(f∘g)(−2) = f(7) = −2 × 7 + 4 = −10"}],"ap":"−10","omr":"num"},{"no":2,"st":1,"q":"f(x) = 3x + 6, g(x) = 2x^{2} + 2x + 2일 때, (g∘f)(−3)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"14","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"f(−3) = 3 × (−3) + 6 = −3","memo":"안쪽 f부터"},{"s":"(g∘f)(−3) = g(−3) = 2 × (−3)^{2} + 2 × (−3) + 2 = 14"}],"ap":"14","omr":"num"},{"no":3,"st":1,"q":"f(x) = 2x − 6, g(x) = 2x^{2} + 2x일 때, (f∘g)(−3)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"18","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"g(−3) = 2 × (−3)^{2} + 2 × (−3) = 12","memo":"안쪽 g부터"},{"s":"(f∘g)(−3) = f(12) = 2 × 12 − 6 = 18"}],"ap":"18","omr":"num"},{"no":4,"st":1,"q":"f(x) = 4x − 3, g(x) = −x^{2} − x일 때, (g∘f)(1)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"−2","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"f(1) = 4 × 1 − 3 = 1","memo":"안쪽 f부터"},{"s":"(g∘f)(1) = g(1) = −1^{2} − 1 = −2"}],"ap":"−2","omr":"num"},{"no":5,"st":2,"q":"f(x) = 3x + 6, g(x) = x^{2} + 4일 때, (f∘g)(−1)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"21","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"g(−1) = (−1)^{2} + 4 = 5","memo":"안쪽 g부터"},{"s":"(f∘g)(−1) = f(5) = 3 × 5 + 6 = 21"}],"ap":"21","omr":"num"},{"no":6,"st":2,"q":"f(x) = 2x + 2, g(x) = 2x^{2} − 3x + 2일 때, (g∘f)(−3)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"46","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"f(−3) = 2 × (−3) + 2 = −4","memo":"안쪽 f부터"},{"s":"(g∘f)(−3) = g(−4) = 2 × (−4)^{2} − 3 × (−4) + 2 = 46"}],"ap":"46","omr":"num"},{"no":7,"st":2,"q":"f(x) = −2x − 1, g(x) = −x^{2} − 3x일 때, (f∘g)(−1)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"−5","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"g(−1) = −(−1)^{2} − 3 × (−1) = 2","memo":"안쪽 g부터"},{"s":"(f∘g)(−1) = f(2) = −2 × 2 − 1 = −5"}],"ap":"−5","omr":"num"},{"no":8,"st":2,"q":"f(x) = 2x − 3, g(x) = 2x^{2} − 3일 때, (g∘f)(3)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"15","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"f(3) = 2 × 3 − 3 = 3","memo":"안쪽 f부터"},{"s":"(g∘f)(3) = g(3) = 2 × 3^{2} − 3 = 15"}],"ap":"15","omr":"num"},{"no":9,"st":3,"q":"f(x) = 2x − 3, g(x) = x^{2} − x + 3일 때, (f∘g)(−3)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"27","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"g(−3) = (−3)^{2} − (−3) + 3 = 15","memo":"안쪽 g부터"},{"s":"(f∘g)(−3) = f(15) = 2 × 15 − 3 = 27"}],"ap":"27","omr":"num"},{"no":10,"st":3,"q":"f(x) = −3x − 2, g(x) = x^{2} − x + 4일 때, (g∘f)(−3)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"46","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"f(−3) = −3 × (−3) − 2 = 7","memo":"안쪽 f부터"},{"s":"(g∘f)(−3) = g(7) = 7^{2} − 7 + 4 = 46"}],"ap":"46","omr":"num"},{"no":11,"st":3,"q":"f(x) = 3x − 5, g(x) = x^{2} − 3x − 3일 때, (f∘g)(−2)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"16","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"g(−2) = (−2)^{2} − 3 × (−2) − 3 = 7","memo":"안쪽 g부터"},{"s":"(f∘g)(−2) = f(7) = 3 × 7 − 5 = 16"}],"ap":"16","omr":"num"},{"no":12,"st":3,"q":"f(x) = 4x − 5, g(x) = −x^{2} + x + 4일 때, (g∘f)(−2)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"−178","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"f(−2) = 4 × (−2) − 5 = −13","memo":"안쪽 f부터"},{"s":"(g∘f)(−2) = g(−13) = −(−13)^{2} + (−13) + 4 = −178"}],"ap":"−178","omr":"num"},{"no":13,"st":4,"q":"f(x) = 3x + 2, g(x) = x^{2}일 때, (f∘g)(−3)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"29","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"g(−3) = (−3)^{2} = 9","memo":"안쪽 g부터"},{"s":"(f∘g)(−3) = f(9) = 3 × 9 + 2 = 29"}],"ap":"29","omr":"num"},{"no":14,"st":4,"q":"f(x) = −2x − 1, g(x) = 2x^{2} − 3x + 1일 때, (g∘f)(3)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"120","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"f(3) = −2 × 3 − 1 = −7","memo":"안쪽 f부터"},{"s":"(g∘f)(3) = g(−7) = 2 × (−7)^{2} − 3 × (−7) + 1 = 120"}],"ap":"120","omr":"num"},{"no":15,"st":4,"q":"f(x) = 3x + 6, g(x) = x^{2} − 3x일 때, (f∘g)(−1)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"18","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"g(−1) = (−1)^{2} − 3 × (−1) = 4","memo":"안쪽 g부터"},{"s":"(f∘g)(−1) = f(4) = 3 × 4 + 6 = 18"}],"ap":"18","omr":"num"},{"no":16,"st":4,"q":"f(x) = 2x + 2, g(x) = −x^{2} + 3x일 때, (g∘f)(−3)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"−28","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"f(−3) = 2 × (−3) + 2 = −4","memo":"안쪽 f부터"},{"s":"(g∘f)(−3) = g(−4) = −(−4)^{2} + 3 × (−4) = −28"}],"ap":"−28","omr":"num"},{"no":17,"st":5,"q":"f(x) = 3x + 3, g(x) = x^{2} − 2일 때, (f∘g)(3)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"24","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"g(3) = 3^{2} − 2 = 7","memo":"안쪽 g부터"},{"s":"(f∘g)(3) = f(7) = 3 × 7 + 3 = 24"}],"ap":"24","omr":"num"},{"no":18,"st":5,"q":"f(x) = −3x + 3, g(x) = −x^{2} + 2x + 1일 때, (g∘f)(3)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"−47","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"f(3) = −3 × 3 + 3 = −6","memo":"안쪽 f부터"},{"s":"(g∘f)(3) = g(−6) = −(−6)^{2} + 2 × (−6) + 1 = −47"}],"ap":"−47","omr":"num"},{"no":19,"st":5,"q":"f(x) = 2x − 1, g(x) = x^{2} − x − 1일 때, (f∘g)(0)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"−3","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"g(0) = 0^{2} − 0 − 1 = −1","memo":"안쪽 g부터"},{"s":"(f∘g)(0) = f(−1) = 2 × (−1) − 1 = −3"}],"ap":"−3","omr":"num"},{"no":20,"st":5,"q":"f(x) = 2x − 6, g(x) = 2x^{2} − 2x + 2일 때, (g∘f)(1)의 값을 구하세요.","ans":"42","plan":"(f∘g)(a) = f(g(a)) — 안쪽부터","lines":[{"s":"f(1) = 2 × 1 − 6 = −4","memo":"안쪽 f부터"},{"s":"(g∘f)(1) = g(−4) = 2 × (−4)^{2} − 2 × (−4) + 2 = 42"}],"ap":"42","omr":"num"}]}